,"article":{"headline":"TJ Smith has pick-6 as Tulane forces 6 turnovers in 31-17 victory over Memphis","description":"— TJ Smith returned an interception 76 yards for a touchdown on the final play of the first half, and Johnnie Daniels raced 48 yards for a score on a fourth-and-1 run with 1:34 remaining as Tulane forced six turnovers in a 31-17 victory over Memphis...","story":"NEW ORLEANS -- — <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5225883/tj-smith\" target=\"_new\">TJ Smith</a> returned an interception 76 yards for a touchdown on the final play of the first half, and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5218820/johnnie-daniels\" target=\"_new\">Johnnie Daniels</a> raced 48 yards for a score on a fourth-and-1 run with 1:34 remaining as Tulane forced six turnovers in a 31-17 victory over Memphis on Friday night.\n\n\r\n              Freshman <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5291713/trace-johnson\" target=\"_new\">Trace Johnson</a> completed 11 for 21 passes for 165 yards for Tulane (3-3, 1-1 American Conference) in his first collegiate start — with a touchdown pass and an interception. \n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5265058/philippe-laforge\" target=\"_new\">Philippe Laforge</a> kicked a 44-yard field goal to give Memphis (5-2, 2-1) the lead on its first possession.\n\n\r\n              Johnson and Tulane picked up two first downs after going three-and-out on its first three drives, leading to a 56-yard field goal by redshirt freshman <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5257395/cooper-helmke\" target=\"_new\">Cooper Helmke</a> to tie it 12 seconds into the second quarter.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5165807/marcus-stokes\" target=\"_new\">Marcus Stokes</a> completed a short pass two plays later to <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079354/stonka-burnside\" target=\"_new\">Stonka Burnside</a>, who turned it into a 76-yard touchdown and Memphis led 10-3.\n\n\r\n              Helmke made a 40-yarder to cut it to 10-6 with 6:47 left before halftime.\n\n\r\n              The Green Wave, who forced one turnover in their first five games, recovered their third fumble of the game to begin a drive at the 50-yard line. Johnson had his first touchdown pass three plays later — a 38-yarder to <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5150834/destyn-hill\" target=\"_new\">Destyn Hill</a> — for a 13-10 lead.\n\n\r\n              Helmke added a 29-yard field goal before Smith's pick-6 for a 23-10 lead at halftime.\n\n\r\n              After a scoreless third quarter, Stokes connected with <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5294438/jemyri-davis\" target=\"_new\">Jemyri Davis</a> for a 6-yard touchdown with 3:34 remaining to cut it to 23-17. The Tigers got the ball back, but <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5121987/kevin-adams\" target=\"_new\">Kevin Adams III</a> picked off his second pass to seal the victory.\n\n\r\n              Stokes finished with 306 yards on 20-for-37 passing with two scores and four interceptions. He also lost two of his three fumbles. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5222671/jaylin-carter\" target=\"_new\">Jaylin Carter</a> had 135 yards on 23 rushes and Burnside totaled 151 yards on seven receptions.\n\n\r\n              Tulane last forced six turnovers in a 34-7 victory over FCS member Jackson State in the 2013 season opener.\n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next</hl2>\r\n              Memphis: Hosts East Carolina on Thursday.\n\n\r\n              Tulane: Hosts UTSA on Oct. 24.\n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"https://apnews.com/newsletters\">Sign up for Top 25 poll alerts here</a>. Visit <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/ap-top-25-college-football-poll\">the Top 25 here</a> and see AP’s full <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/college-football\">college football coverage here.</a>","published":"2026-10-17T03:28:26Z"}}